# Wave T54 (Clashfield kit): basaltfloor — Clashfield's registered street kind (the fleet's street kinds carry the -floor suffix; the desire-path tiers key on it). FITTED BASALT SLABS: large dark basalt slabs (blue-grey faces, tone-varied) set in pale grout with offset jittered joints and sparse rust-red weather flecks — the hard coast's hard road. A FITTED-SLAB FIELD: unlike Shardfall's shardfloor (a regular blue-grey checker), Coalseam's clinkerfloor (fine dark ash), Bridgeport's ringfloor (ringed quay stone), Brightshore's panelfloor (a rigid golden grid). (NO-SAME-KIT law; WAVE-T54-CLASHFIELD-PLAN.md §5.)
